  "fixture": "F23-solution-multi-repo",
  "description": "A multi-repository solution: a TypeScript front end (member web) calling a FastAPI orders service (member orders) that reads the orders table through SQLAlchemy, and the orders database's catalogue dump as the solution's inputs. golden_check compiles each member in its own repository, loads .rkp/solution.json and checks the identity links across members: a call that states its method links exactly to the endpoint with that method and path, the one call path a single endpoint serves links exactly, a call whose method is unstated stays a candidate, the service's tables and columns link to the catalogue's, a configuration key both members read is only a lead, and a path no member serves is unmatched. The commits make the service serve that path, map a second table, and drop the front end's configuration read.",
